1794714947.358861 write(3</output/guardianai-linux-x86_64/RUNNING.txt>, "GuardianAI core runtime for Linux x86-64\n\nRequires Python 3.10+, Bubblewrap with user namespaces, and strace with native stack support.\nProvide TYPESAFE_API_KEY only to the trusted supervisor environment.\nUse a dedicated public input directory, an empty output directory and a new evidence directory.\nKeep protected resources outside every public/runtime mount; snapshots are limited to 32 KiB.\n\npython3 guarded_agent.py --task \"Read the approved summary\" --workspace /path/to/public --output /path/to/empty-output --evidence /path/to/new-evidence --sensor /path/to/strace --resource summary=/path/to/private/summary.txt -- /usr/bin/cat /protected/summary\n\nWorkers cannot install their own seccomp filters in this profile.\nPrivate /var/run/nscd/socket and /run/nscd/socket connects receive emulated ENOENT without executing a connection. Other connect requests stop the scope.\nRequires strace --kill-on-exit and a guard-version-1 helper. The trusted tracer is tied to the supervising Linux thread by SIGKILL parent-death not"..., 1952) = 1952
